mso-font-kerning:1.0000pt;"><font face="仿宋"><p>This course is an important basic theoretical course in the medical curriculum system to clarify the laws of various life activities manifested by various systems, organs, tissues and cells of the normal human body, the generation mechanism of various life phenomena, the interconnection and interaction between various systems, organs, tissues and cells, and the influence of changes in the internal and external environment of the body on life activities.</p></font></span><span style="font-family:'Times New Roman';mso-fareast-font-family:仿宋;font-size:10.5000pt;
